<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Nouvel abonnement</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f5f5f5; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; }
        .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0055A4 0%, #003d7a 100%); color: white; padding: 20px; text-align: center; }
        .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 22px; }
        .content { padding: 30px; }
        .amount { font-size: 36px; font-weight: 700; color: #10b981; text-align: center; margin: 20px 0; }
        .amount span { font-size: 18px; color: #6b7280; }
        .info-card { background: #f8f9fa; border-left: 4px solid #10b981; padding: 15px 20px; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; }
        .info-row { display: flex; margin: 8px 0; }
        .info-label { font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; min-width: 140px; }
        .info-value { color: #1f2937; }
        .footer { background: #1f2937; color: #9ca3af; padding: 15px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; }
        .badge { display: inline-block; background: #0055A4; color: white; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Nouvel abonnement</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p><span class="badge">PAIEMENT RECU</span></p>

            <div class="amount">
                {{ package.price }} EUR <span>/ {{ package.durationInMonths }} mois</span>
            </div>

            <p>Un nouvel abonnement vient d'etre souscrit sur Passe Civique.</p>

            <div class="info-card">
                <h4 style="margin-top: 0; color: #1f2937;">Informations client</h4>
                <div class="info-row">
                    <span class="info-label">Nom complet</span>
                    <span class="info-value">{{ user.fullName }}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="info-row">
                    <span class="info-label">Email</span>
                    <span class="info-value">{{ user.email }}</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="info-card">
                <h4 style="margin-top: 0; color: #1f2937;">Details abonnement</h4>
                <div class="info-row">
                    <span class="info-label">Formule</span>
                    <span class="info-value">{{ package.name }}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="info-row">
                    <span class="info-label">Duree</span>
                    <span class="info-value">{{ package.durationInMonths }} mois</span>
                </div>
                <div class="info-row">
                    <span class="info-label">Date debut</span>
                    <span class="info-value">{{ subscription.startDate|date('d/m/Y') }}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="info-row">
                    <span class="info-label">Date fin</span>
                    <span class="info-value">{{ subscription.endDate|date('d/m/Y') }}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="info-row">
                    <span class="info-label">Statut</span>
                    <span class="info-value" style="color: #10b981; font-weight: 600;">{{ subscription.status|upper }}</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>Notification automatique - Passe Civique Admin</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
